  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c1419099",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## __EXPLANATION__\n",
    "\n",
    "This box plot shows the distribution of students’ Academic Performance (GPA).\n",
    "\n",
    "* The middle line in the box is the median GPA, which is about 3.55.\n",
    "* The box shows where most students’ GPAs are found, roughly between 3.25 and 3.80.\n",
    "* The whiskers show the wider range of normal GPA values, from about 2.65 to 4.05.\n",
    "* The outliers show that few students have unusually low GPAs, around 2.4–2.7.\n",
    "* Overall, the plot shows that most students are concentrated around 3.25–3.80."
   ]
  },
